  "ingredients": [
    "4 ripe tomatoes, sliced",
    "4 tablespoons mayonnaise",
    "4 tablespoons Parmesan cheese",
    "1 tablespoon Dijon mustard",
    "1 tablespoon brown mustard",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh parsley",
    "0.25 cup shredded mozzarella cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1LMQEFn0lYnNwbiv6Ce8LD8AcYE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-50187-parmesan-tomatoes-VAT-step-01-59f37eeada12493fb80108cad63e4add.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/50187/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange tomato slices in a single layer on a baking sheet. In a small bowl, mix together mayonnaise, parmesan, Dijon mustard, and brown mustard. Season with oregano, and salt and pepper to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D-tRpiiTycGk0UtcAm9gfdA0p4c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-50187-parmesan-tomatoes-VAT-step-02-5339c32bc4ac4ef79cd55f3314d76fdc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/50187/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a spoon to top each tomato slice with a small amount of the mayonnaise mixture. Sprinkle with mozzarella , and then top with parsley.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UTctFOCI2FThgs7hVHrYnw4SI4g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-50187-parmesan-tomatoes-VAT-step-03-f7aa2969698d4cf3a5d57d5f49af8e16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/50187/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven for approximately 15 minutes, or until golden brown. Serve immediately.",
